From 891163f75fa57ca1b83c3604d9af6de25bfac098 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:54:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mcp): edit_user_holder edits a user holder by its
 shape fields

The new MCP tool takes the holder form's shape fields (taper, clamp,
bore, gauge_len, nose_d, largest_d, name), builds the outline with
HolderShape::geometry and runs the same undoable EditDocumentComponent
as the form's Apply. Shape errors carry the ShapeError text; a broken
fit names the tool. The generated reference and the guide name the tool.

Fixes #4391

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
